{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/8410bc0a9f8e0d57d882cfe1012a5f14.avif?t=1767665888\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras_big/8410bc0a9f8e0d57d882cfe1012a5f14.avif?t=1767665888 width=1560 height=392 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude90 \u00a0Travel the cosmos, and find the hearts! \u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storybook universe awaits. Travel the stars in search of lost hearts tucked away inside lovingly hand-crafted ballpoint illustrations. Offbeat and fanciful planets await in this cozy, hidden-object jaunt through space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1767665888\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras_big/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1767665888 width=1560 height=1184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude90 Solve planetary puzzles!\u00a0\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just search! Each planet is filled with unique and whimsical puzzles. Take a spin at the slot machine, play instruments, master the mini-game, and manipulate levers to rotate entire planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world. Unlock rockets to expand the map. Visit distant stars or catch up with familiar friends. You can even check out the vibes in deep space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits. Explore the vast and cozy universe at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to charming planets as you plot your own leisurely path across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/bbe8b5c8ce89f074a09c3ce5802bdd74.avif?t=1767665888\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Hand-drawn art \ud83d\udd8a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just search! Each planet is filled with unique and whimsical puzzles. Take a spin at the slot machine, play instruments, master the mini-game, and manipulate levers to rotate entire planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world. Unlock rockets to expand the map. Visit distant stars or catch up with familiar friends. You can even check out the vibes in deep space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits. Explore the vast and cozy universe at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to charming planets as you plot your own leisurely path across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/f32b0aac8c132f3ede3b1effebe9b05e.avif?t=1767665888\" width=1560 height=996 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb6 A heartwarming soundtrack \ud83c\udfb9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original piano music composed by renowned former Nintendo composer Daisuke Shiiba. Music was recorded live, using reel-to-reel tape, for a rich, calm, analog sound that breathes warm life into this curious galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/c88d73565be5741907851e4995de40aa.avif?t=1767665888\" width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: click, drag &amp; drop, and mousewheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit. For a hidden object game that feels like turning the pages of a storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages young to old. And for gamers and non-gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your heart, with this relaxing voyage of galactic discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.gif?t=1767665888\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.poster.avif?t=1767665888\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/5deeac7e19c0bfcded7ba617a899c6ff561c769f.jpg"},{"name":"Meteorite completed.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/f3e090d4b7148854d2062d7321403282a3efd82d.jpg"},{"name":"First hearts given!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/d3cbc083cf0348742bd63e6e78aabc23d9f91b09.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv2.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/10a8bfaccb02c2184745820bfd15547d4bf6fb17.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/dfe58e430bf6c10ed434c3b5d88304c4de0f077b.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/a79ed86aa37cb5ccc5039f8be66bd8507cd53aab.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/d4c1880163cd2f186c9b49a8aa4311c76f9ee087.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/debc646338f10d15b39623c1a330c4c3c4863c54.jpg"},{"name":"Mor