e.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to charming planets as you plot your own leisurely path across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/f32b0aac8c132f3ede3b1effebe9b05e.avif?t=1767665888\" width=1560 height=996 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb6 A heartwarming soundtrack \ud83c\udfb9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original piano music composed by renowned former Nintendo composer Daisuke Shiiba. Music was recorded live, using reel-to-reel tape, for a rich, calm, analog sound that breathes warm life into this curious galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/c88d73565be5741907851e4995de40aa.avif?t=1767665888\" width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: click, drag &amp; drop, and mousewheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit. For a hidden object game that feels like turning the pages of a storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages young to old. And for gamers and non-gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your heart, with this relaxing voyage of galactic discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.gif?t=1767665888\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.poster.avif?t=1767665888\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>","developers":["asaha"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id"